        "text": "6.2.2.5 Building 31 consists of three York large tonnage centrifugal chillers 1200-ton capacity 4160 Volt remote mounted Variable Frequency Drives Toshiba with full services. These chillers are Model YK by York. The fourth unit is in Building #31 an earlier model design all at the same capacity of 1200-480 Volt tons for a 4800-ton approximate plant capacity. Plant consists of all pumps, towers, strainers, starters etc. The fourth unit has a unit mounted 4160 MVVSD and all necessary maintenance"
